(Project Horizon - Green Edge AI Data Center Charter \(2026\)) Tj T*
(Document Code: PRJ-HORIZON-2026 | Location: Bandung, Indonesia | Lead SRE: Dr. Hendra Wijaya) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Executive Summary & Cooling Target) Tj T*
(Project Horizon establishes a 5 MW solar-assisted Edge AI data center in Bandung.) Tj T*
(By deploying two-phase liquid immersion cooling, the facility reduces cooling power) Tj T*
(consumption by 35% compared to traditional air-cooled server rooms.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Budget Allocation & Project Phases) Tj T*
(The total approved capital budget is USD 4,200,000 divided into three phases:) Tj T*
(- Phase 1 \(Site Preparation & Solar Microgrid\): USD 1,100,000 completing in Q2 2026.) Tj T*
(- Phase 2 \(Server Racks & AI Accelerator Deployment\): USD 2,400,000 completing in Q3 2026.) Tj T*
(- Phase 3 \(Commissioning, Penetration Testing & Safety Audit\): USD 700,000 completing in Q4 2026.) Tj T*
(Any budget variance exceeding 10% requires written sign-off from the Investment Committee.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Reliability, Thermal Thresholds & Escalation) Tj T*
(The facility targets a minimum service availability of 99.95% annual uptime.) Tj T*
(If liquid coolant temperature exceeds 42 degrees Celsius, automated workload throttling) Tj T*
(activates within 30 seconds and pages Lead SRE Dr. Hendra Wijaya immediately.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. Battery Backup & Environmental Compliance) Tj T*
(Lithium Iron Phosphate \(LFP\) battery banks provide 18 hours of reserve power at full load.) Tj T*
(All decommissioned hardware and e-waste must be processed by ISO-14001 certified recyclers.) Tj T*
